// The Lucide icons (lucide.dev, ISC licence: LICENSE.txt beside this file), as a font: DATA is its face (font.load_embedded),
// and each constant one icon's character in it, named as Lucide names it (house is HOME: the font's older name). A program
// draws an icon as text in that face. One set for every program of the toolkit: add a constant here when one needs an icon
// that has none yet (its code point: the font's character map, under the icon's name).
package tk_lucide

